    "SVGStringList.clear() leaves the requiredExtensions/systemLanguage attribute \"\" natively; Chromium 156 removes it. Both lists report numberOfItems 0 and the element is valid.",
    "systemLanguage serialises with \", \" natively; Chromium 156 uses \",\".",
    "requiredExtensions=\"\" holds one empty item natively; Chromium 156 reports none."
